<title>PHILIPPINES: Cosmos sets one-for-five stock rights.</title>
<headline>Cosmos sets one-for-five stock rights.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippines' Cosmos Bottling Corp would offer a one-for-five stock rights to shareholders as of October 10, the Philippine Stock Exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The softdrink company is offering the shares at 2.10 pesos per share.</p>
<p>The rights offering will be open from October 28 to November 11. - Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
